               expression of key DNA replication components is important to
               shape stem cell chromatin. Furthermore, manipulating one crucial
               DNA replication component can induce replication-coupled histone
               dynamics in nonstem cells to resemble those in stem cells.",
  journal   = "Sci. Adv.",
  publisher = "American Association for the Advancement of Science (AAAS)",
  volume    =  11,
  number    =  9,
